{"id": "86096", "name": "דוגמה לפונקציה עם נקודה סטציונרית בנקודה נתונה (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Give an example of a function \\(f(x)\\) with a stationary point at \\(x={{CT:0}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> In this question you are asked to find a function with the property that there is a stationary point at \\(x={{CT:0}}\\).  That is to say that the gradient here will be zero.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Two ways to build one</b><br>There are two main ways to go about this<ul><li>Take a known function and graph shift it to put the stationary point in the correct place.</li><li>Take a function with a zero in the correct place an integrate it.</li></ul>There are many different examples.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — An example</b><br>Shift \\(x^4\\), whose derivative \\(4x^3\\) vanishes at \\(0\\), by \\({{CT:0}}\\) to the right:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)={{CT:1}},\\qquad f'(x)={{CT:2}} \\]</p>so \\(f'({{CT:0}})=0\\). One answer is therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)={{CT:1}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "p:subst(n,x,diff(ans1,x));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "p", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["n"], "nvariants": 4}